    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/c12539592590af9a122d39e6364d7690.poster.avif?t=1746025808\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/c12539592590af9a122d39e6364d7690.webm?t=1746025808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/c12539592590af9a122d39e6364d7690.mp4?t=1746025808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About this game</strong><br>Dive into a dystopian future with <i>Heart: Future Whispers</i>, a top-down shooter that will push your skills to the limit. Investigate the vision of Mystra, where all bonds have been shattered, and uncover who is behind the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/44d82b128cdf5f91ad33c95f24c1427f.poster.avif?t=1746025808\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/44d82b128cdf5f91ad33c95f24c1427f.webm?t=1746025808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/44d82b128cdf5f91ad33c95f24c1427f.mp4?t=1746025808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos Discovery</strong><br>Face hordes of enemies that attack periodically, testing your tactics and reflexes. Utilize a variety of weapons to survive intense battles and unveil the dark secrets that threaten the world's existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/820eec30b79ef6c75f1e576f4cbb4080.poster.avif?t=1746025808\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/820eec30b79ef6c75f1e576f4cbb4080.webm?t=1746025808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/820eec30b79ef6c75f1e576f4cbb4080.mp4?t=1746025808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong><br>By eliminating enemies, accumulate money that can be used to acquire unique weapons. Carefully manage your resources to buy the most powerful weapons, prolong your survival, and face increasingly greater challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/44d82b128cdf5f91ad33c95f24c1427f.poster.avif?t=1746025808\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/44d82b128cdf5f91ad33c95f24c1427f.webm?t=1746025808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/44d82b128cdf5f91ad33c95f24c1427f.mp4?t=1746025808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong><br>In infinite mode, survive as many waves as possible and see who can score the most points. The difficulty constantly increases\u2014who will set the high score?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to face humanity\u2019s greatest threat. Are you ready for the battle?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/c12539592590af9a122d39e6364d7690.poster.avif?t=1746025808\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/c12539592590af9a122d39e6364d7690.webm?t=1746025808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/c12539592590af9a122d39e6364d7690.mp4?t=1746025808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About this game</strong><br>Dive into a dystopian future with <i>Heart: Future Whispers</i>, a top-down shooter that will push your skills to the limit. Investigate the vision of Mystra, where all bonds have been shattered, and uncover who is behind the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/44d82b128cdf5f91ad33c95f24c1427f.poster.avif?t=1746025808\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/44d82b128cdf5f91ad33c95f24c1427f.webm?t=1746025808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/44d82b128cdf5f91ad33c95f24c1427f.mp4?t=1746025808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos Discovery</strong><br>Face hordes of enemies that attack periodically, testing your tactics and reflexes. Utilize a variety of weapons to survive intense battles and unveil the dark secrets that threaten the world's existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/820eec30b79ef6c75f1e576f4cbb4080.poster.avif?t=1746025808\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/820eec30b79ef6c75f1e576f4cbb4080.webm?t=1746025808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/820eec30b79ef6c75f1e576f4cbb4080.mp4?t=1746025808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong><br>By eliminating enemies, accumulate money that can be used to acquire unique weapons. Carefully manage your resources to buy the most powerful weapons, prolong your survival, and face increasingly greater challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/44d82b128cdf5f91ad33c95f24c1427f.poster.avif?t=1746025808\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/44d82b128cdf5f91ad33c95f24c1427f.webm?t=1746025808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/44d82b128cdf5f91ad33c95f24c1427f.mp4?t=1746025808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong><br>In infinite mode, survive as many waves as possible and see who can score the most points. The difficulty constantly increases\u2014who will set the high score?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to face humanity\u2019s greatest threat. Are you ready for the battle?</p>",
    "short_description": "Heart: Future Whispers is a top-down shooter set in a dystopian future. Face hordes of enemies, manage resources to acquire powerful weapons, and uncover the dark secrets behind the chaos. Test your skills in infinite mode and fight for the highest score!",
